w/aurivita.co?page=6\"}]\n\nI didn't find any Amazon reviews for Aurivita Cayenne Pepper in these results. Every hit was a Trustpilot page for the company, so this is a summary of Trustpilot reviews, not Amazon ones.\n\n- **Overall rating:** Trustpilot shows a 4.4 score from roughly 664 to 676 reviews, depending on the page version (TrustScore 4.5 out of 5, 676 reviews).\n- **Positive comments:** Several reviewers credit the softgels with energy, circulation, and urinary improvements, though the reports are anecdotal. One says more energy, more alert, more focused. Another reports that it helps improve blood circulation and has lessened neuropathy in their arms and hands. Others note that the softgels are easy to swallow and that delivery was on time (\"These gels are soft & easy to swallow.\").\n- **Negative comments:** Complaints focus on shipping and customer contact. One reviewer says Aurivita won't accept my phone calls and has not responded to my emails. Another said taking 3 on an empty stomach gives a burning sensation to the stomach and makes them sweat. One reviewer said they had not received an RA number to return the product and get a refund.\n- **Customer service:** Many reviews praise the company's responsiveness, including replacing lost orders without fuss.\n- **Caveat:** The product description notes that these statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.\n\nFor Amazon-specific ratings, a follow-up search for the Amazon listing itself would be needed.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"c790ffde-1b04-4455-a1ca-59bd4e0b788a","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:00:53.304Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Aurivita Cayenne Pepper reviews amazon","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011rKxFSLtHc9VgTFWAbjmzq","content":[{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://uk.trustpilot.com/re