he softgels with energy, circulation, and urinary improvements, though the reports are anecdotal. One says more energy, more alert, more focused. Another reports that it helps improve blood circulation and has lessened neuropathy in their arms and hands. Others note that the softgels are easy to swallow and that delivery was on time (\"These gels are soft & easy to swallow.\").\n- **Negative comments:** Complaints focus on shipping and customer contact. One reviewer says Aurivita won't accept my phone calls and has not responded to my emails. Another said taking 3 on an empty stomach gives a burning sensation to the stomach and makes them sweat. One reviewer said they had not received an RA number to return the product and get a refund.\n- **Customer service:** Many reviews praise the company's responsiveness, including replacing lost orders without fuss.\n- **Caveat:** The product description notes that these statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.\n\nFor Amazon-specific ratings, a follow-up search for the Amazon listing itself would be needed."],"durationSeconds":8.338561334,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HwwC9Wfbcy4FGsDDhVk8bh","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
