gion=us\"},{\"title\":\"Chuyển đến nội dung chính\",\"url\":\"https://blogtamtu123.blogspot.com/2026/01/1-teaspoon-of-this-everyday-spice-may.html\"},{\"title\":\"does cayenne pepper increase circulation\",\"url\":\"https://ntro.it.com/does-cayenne-pepper-increase-circulation\"},{\"title\":\"Author Anecdotes\",\"url\":\"https://www.fieryfoodscentral.com/2008/07/02/the-healing-powers-of-hot-peppers-part-1-cayenne-as-a-curative/3/\"},{\"title\":\"www.mskcc.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.mskcc.org/pdf/cancer-care/patient-education/herbs/cayenne\"}]\n\nI didn't find any Reddit threads in these results, so this is based on blogs, forums, and supplement pages instead.\n\n- **Forum reports are mixed.** One user on a People's Pharmacy forum said a large daily dose of cayenne capsules eased numbness and foot pain within days, and called it a strong circulation effect. [peoplespharmacy.com](https://peoplespharmacy.com/articles/hot-pepper-to-ease-pain) Another person on a fieryfoodscentral page said capsules left them rarely needing socks and their hands and feet noticeably warmer. [fieryfoodscentral.com](https://www.fieryfoodscentral.com/2008/07/02/the-healing-powers-of-hot-peppers-part-1-cayenne-as-a-curative/3/) A HealthUnlocked poster said the approach worked for them some of the time, but not every time. [healthunlocked.com](https://healthunlocked.com/sruk/posts/823918/cure-with-cayenne)\n- **Supplement and wellness sites promote it.** Naturally Savvy recommends cayenne capsules taken before cold exposure as its top pick for cold extremities. [naturallysavvy.com](https://naturallysavvy.com/blog/cold-hands-and-feet) A Substack naturopath says a pinch of cayenne before going out can keep hands and feet warm. [substack.com](https://izzyseadon.substack.com/p/cold-hands-warm-heartcold-feet-neglected) Some of these pages are selling products or courses, so treat them with caution.\n- **Evidence is thin.** One explainer describes the warming effect as anecdotal and historical, not clinically proven. [ntro.it.com](https://ntro.it.com/does-cayenne-pepper-increase-circulation) MSK's patient page notes only that cayenne is used in traditional medicine for circulation. [mskcc.org](https://www.mskcc.org/pdf/cancer-care/patient-education/herbs/cayenne)\n- **Cold hands and feet can have medical causes.** Raynaud's, thyroid problems, and some medications can all cause them, and one AARP thread notes that beta-blockers and stimulants like Sudafed can reduce blood flow to the extremities. [community.aarp.org](https://community.aarp.org/t5/Healthy-Living/Cold-hands-amp-feet-from-medicines/m-p/2348562) Talking to a doctor first is sensible, especially if the symptoms are new or one-sided, or if there is color change or pain.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"ea02f84f-1643-435d-8541-dd9b581cf1a9","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:00:53.510Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"reddit cayenne pepper capsules circulation cold hands feet experience","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01GVPAubZvuZWDoJ2b6TbN3T","content":[{"title":"hot pepper to ease pain","url":"https://peoplespharmacy.com/articles/hot-pepper-to-ease-pain"},{"title":"Cayenne pepper - improved my circulation & warmth","url":"https://www.s4me.info/threads/cayenne-pepper-improved-my-circulation-warmth.41646"},{"title":"Q: In the winter my hands and feet are always cold. Is there anything I can do about this?","url":"https://naturallysavvy.com/blog/cold-hands-and-feet"},{"title":"Cold Hands and Feet","url":"https://naturallysavvy.com/?p=56457"},{"title":"cure with cayenne","url":"https://healthunlocked.com/sruk/posts/823918/cure-with-cayenne"},{"title":"Content starts here","url":"https://community.aarp.org/t5/Healthy-Living/Cold-hands-amp-feet-from-medicines/m-p/2348562"},{"title":"The Benefits of Cayenne Pepper for Treating Coldness and Arthritis","u