{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013LXcvmUC6rRimtttsQ3Hfx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"aurivita.co cayenne pepper softgels supplement facts hawthorn beets turmeric D3 K2 directions\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"- Vegetarian/vegan\",\"url\":\"https://swansonvitamins.com/products/now-foods-cayenne-100-caps\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://ca.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=6\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=10\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=9\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=5\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://au.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=5\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://nz.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=8\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=5\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://nz.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=6\"},{\"title\":\"api.ods.od.nih.gov\",\"url\":\"https://api.ods.od.nih.gov/dsld/s3/pdf/36305.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://de.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=4\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=3\"},{\"title\":\"api.ods.od.nih.gov\",\"url\":\"https://api.ods.od.nih.gov/dsld/s3/pdf/80266.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"natures way cayenne pepper 450 mg 100 caps\",\"url\":\"https://www.swansonvitamins.com/p/natures-way-cayenne-pepper-450-mg-100-caps\"}]\n\nI couldn't find the full Aurivita label. None of the results list hawthorn, turmeric, vitamin D3, or vitamin K2, and I couldn't confirm directions for use.\n\nWhat the results did show:\n\n- **Product description:** Aurivita's cayenne softgels are described as a concentrated dose of cayenne pepper (Capsicum annuum) rich in naturally occurring capsaicin, made with a high-quality standardized extract.\n- **Beet root:** One Trustpilot reviewer refers to the cayenne softgels with beet root, so beet appears to be part of at least one version. This is a customer's remark, not the label.\n- **Batches:** A reviewer says this batch of Aurivita is different from the first batch that I had purchased. The formulation may have changed over time.\n- **Other products:** A reviewer mentions their garlic supplement, which is a separate product.\n\nThe results were mostly Trustpilot customer reviews, which are unverified and not a substitute for the label. For the exact ingredient amounts, serving size, directions, and any warnings, check the Supplement Facts panel on aurivita.co or the bottle you have. If you have the label, I can help you read it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"d1590222-535a-4bc0-93af-aa8979859d5a","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:01:04.609Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"aurivita.co cayenne pepper softgels supplement facts hawthorn beets turmeric D3 K2 directions","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Asw7hZoEPxnnw7hUeVZMvS","content":[{"title":"- Vegetarian/vegan","url":"https://swansonvitamins.com/products/now-foods-cayenne-100-caps"},{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://ca.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=6"},{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=10"},{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=9"},{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=5"},{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://au.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.