ega típica en zonas urbanas: 70-85% cuando hay confirmación previa por WhatsApp o IA de voz. Es una afirmación de un operador que vende este servicio, no un estudio independiente.\n\nSobre WhatsApp en particular, los resultados solo mencionan la confirmación de pedidos por ese canal, no una participación de compras. Para cifras de adopción por WhatsApp haría falta una búsqueda específica, por ejemplo sobre estudios de la CCCE o de Fenalco."],"durationSeconds":7.679185999999994,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0189J6187ZrtqjXSJTEfD9xD","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AbRDsSMwoaCxb5rLjzNphx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"amazon cayenne pepper capsules reviews burning stomach \"cold feet\" circulation energy customers say\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/179105180\"},{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/108316320\"},{\"title\":\"cayenne capsules\",\"url\":\"https://shop.app/products/1399873732671/cayenne-capsules\"},{\"title\":\"Pros & Cons\",\"url\":\"https://www.fakespot.com/product/solgar-520-mg-cayenne-vegetable-capsules-pack-of-100\"},{\"title\":\"Ask Fakespot Chat questions about this productAlpha\",\"url\":\"https://www.fakespot.com/product/natures-way-cayenne-pepper-450-mg-180-capsules-pack-of-2\"},{\"title\":\"cayenne pepper capsules ultra complex with cinnamon ginger cardamom hawthorn berry support digestion circulation overall wellness 180 count pack of 1\",\"url\":\"https://fakespot.com/product/cayenne-pepper-capsules-ultra-complex-with-cinnamon-ginger-cardamom-hawthorn-berry-support-digestion-circulation-overall-wellness-180-count-pack-of-1\"},{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/47486922\"},{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/5218801728\"},{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/NOW-Supplements-Cayenne-Capsicum-annuum-500-mg-250-Capsules/223195947\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=7\"},{\"title\":\"Ask Fakespot Chat questions about this productAlpha\",\"url\":\"https://www.fakespot.com/product/oregon-s-wild-harvest-cayenne-organic-90-count\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=8\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=9\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=10\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=9\"},{\"title\":\"Banner for Aurivita\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=6\"}]\n\nI ran one search. It did not turn up any Amazon reviews mentioning \"cold feet,\" and most of what it returned came from Fakespot summaries of Amazon reviews, Walmart listings, and Trustpilot rather than Amazon pages directly.\n\n**Stomach burning:** The clearest complaint is a Fakespot summary of Amazon reviews for a Solgar cayenne product. One reviewer said burning persisted for hours even after taking the capsules with a meal, and that they needed antacid tablets to manage it Ive tried taking them immediately after a meal but they still burn the heck out of my stomach which lasts for hours. A Nature's Way reviewer suggested pairing the cayenne with milk helps to prevent the burn.\n\n**Other digestive effects:** On a different cayenne capsule, one Amazon reviewer reported gas after taking it with breakfast, and another reported a strong bowel reaction about an hour after a capsule About an hour after taking 1 capsule after lunch i experienced an extreme bowel purging. Another reviewer on a Wild Harvest product said it was mild enough that it's not so hot that it gives heartburn.\n\n**Circulation and energy:** Positive circulation and energy reports came mainly from Trustpilot, not Amazon. One Aurivita reviewer said their energy returned and blood flow improved I feel like my energy has returned and blood flow has improved. A Amazon reviewer on the Nature's Way product was still waiting to see whether their circulation improved, and said the burning sensation only lasts maybe 5 minutes but its very uncomfortable.\n\n**Manufacturer claims:** Solaray says its processing keeps the cayenne in its natural, spicy-hot form without burning your stomach. That is the company's claim, not independent evidence.\n\n**Caveat on reliability:** Fakespot's analysis of the Wild Harvest listing estimated that 32.6% of the reviews are reliable. Treat the Amazon review snippets here as anecdotal. For a fuller picture, check the Amazon listing directly for the specific product you are considering.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"a85fbf23-4fdf-46bd-bce0-276ed7a33d92","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:01:26.345Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"amazon cayenne pepper capsules reviews burning stomach \"cold feet\" circulation energy customers say","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_015dxJQh1xbwGb6LSWNvy7dW","content":[{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/179105180"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/108316320"},{"title":"cayenne capsules","url":"https://shop.app/products/1399873732671/cayenne-capsules"},{"title":"Pros & Cons","url":"https://www.fakespot.com/product/solgar-520-mg-cayenne-vegetable-capsules-pack-of-100"},{"title":"Ask Fakespot Chat questions about this productAlpha","url":"https://www.fakespot.com/product/natures-way-cayenne-pepper-450-mg-180-capsules-pack-of-2"},{"title":"cayenne pepper capsules ultra complex with cinnamon ginger cardamom hawthorn berry support digestion circulation overall wellness 180 count pack of 1","url":"https://fakespot.com/product/cayenne-pepper-capsules-ultra-complex-with-cinnamon-ginger-cardamom-hawthorn-berry-support-digestion-circulation-overall-wellness-180-count-pack-of-1"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/47486922"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/5218801728"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/NOW-Supplements-Cayenne-Capsicum-annuum-500-mg-250-Capsules/223195947"},{"title":"Banner for Aurivita","url":"https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/aurivita.co?page=7"},{"tit