{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VrAt2QwDpGMo7ZHkvM8PMu","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"tiktok cayenne pepper pills trend circulation \"cayenne\" softgel viral 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"10 TikTok Health Trends Worth Trying—and Avoiding\",\"url\":\"https://www.parsleyhealth.com/blog/tiktok-health-trends/\"},{\"title\":\"44 million people viewed viral 201602078\",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/44-million-people-viewed-viral-201602078.html\"},{\"title\":\"TikTokers Claim This 'Skinny Girl Shot' Helps You Lose Weight & Here's What It Really Does\",\"url\":\"https://www.narcity.com/tiktokers-claim-this-skinny-girl-shot-helps-you-lose-weight-heres-what-it-really-does\"},{\"title\":\"dailydot.com\",\"url\":\"https://dailydot.com/?p=1650053\"},{\"title\":\"www.tiktokshop.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.tiktokshop.com/pdp/cayenne-pepper-softgels-supplement-supports-circulation/1731315079510725077\"},{\"title\":\"A spicy chip challenge left one child dead and several others hospitalized. Here's why the chip is so dangerous\",\"url\":\"https://www.mdlinx.com/article/a-spicy-chip-challenge-left-one-child-dead-and-several-others-hospitalized-heres-why-the-chip-is-so/3BQNtf6wREdIi1SR7QWHiV\"},{\"title\":\"skip to main content\",\"url\":\"https://www.target.com/s/cayenne+pepper+capsules?Nao=864\"},{\"title\":\"Woman claims wellness influencer’s advice sent her to hospital with burnt esophagus\",\"url\":\"https://malaysia.news.yahoo.com/woman-claims-wellness-influencer-advice-214139577.html\"},{\"title\":\"Woman claims wellness influencer’s advice sent her to hospital with burnt esophagus\",\"url\":\"https://www.aol.com/woman-claims-wellness-influencer-advice-214139340.html\"},{\"title\":\"orange constipation hack\",\"url\":\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/ravenishak/orange-constipation-hack\"},{\"title\":\"www.tiktokshop.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.tiktokshop.com/pdp/cayenne-pepper-softgels-for-circulation-vitality-240-count/1731990967497298097\"},{\"title\":\"naturopath promotes scientifically unsubstantiated claim cayenne pepper most powerful blood thinner\",\"url\":\"https://science.feedback.org/review/naturopath-promotes-scientifically-unsubstantiated-claim-cayenne-pepper-most-powerful-blood-thinner\"},{\"title\":\"The TikTok Food Trend So Bizarre The FDA Had To Get Involved\",\"url\":\"https://www.aol.com/articles/tiktok-food-trend-bizarre-fda-003500493.html\"},{\"title\":\"tiktok health trends\",\"url\":\"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/tiktok-health-trends/\"},{\"title\":\"www.mskcc.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.mskcc.org/node/3219\"},{\"title\":\"what are the ingredients in the coffee loophole tiktok\",\"url\":\"https://ntro.it.com/what-are-the-ingredients-in-the-coffee-loophole-tiktok\"},{\"title\":\"tiktok trend\",\"url\":\"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/tag/tiktok-trend?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"The Viral Rise (and Risks) of Chilli Challenges\",\"url\":\"https://www.futura-sciences.com/en/?p=37121\"}]\n\nThe search didn't find any reporting that a specific 2025 TikTok trend around cayenne softgels went viral. What it did turn up:\n\n- **Marketing:** TikTok Shop listings sell cayenne softgels, often bundled with vitamin D3+K2, beetroot, and hawthorn, and promote them for leg vein, heart, and circulation support. One listing shows 47.3K units sold. Sold by VIVONU S, 4.4 (3.2k), 47.3K sold\n- **Circulation claims:** Memorial Sloan Kettering notes that cayenne has traditionally been used to support digestion and blood circulation. Cayenne pepper is also used in traditional medicine to improve digestion and blood circulation. It also advises speaking with a healthcare provider before taking cayenne supplements. Talk with your healthcare providers before taking cayenne supplements.\n- **Unsupported claims:** Science Feedback reviewed a TikTok claim that cayenne is the most powerful blood thinner and found no scientific support for it. There is no scientific evidence supporting the use of cayenne pepper as a blood thinner.\n- **Safety concern:** One case report, cited by a medical news outlet, describes a healthy young man who had severe chest pain and a heart attack after taking \"slimming\" cayenne pepper pills. In fact, one healthy young male experienced severe chest pain and extensive inferior myocardial infarction after taking \"slimming\" cayenne pepper pills, according to the International Journal of Emergency Medicine. This is a single case, and I didn't verify the original report.\n\nGaps: I found no 2025 sales or trend data, and nothing from the FDA or a major outlet specifically on cayenne softgels. A follow-up search on FDA or poison-control warnings about cayenne supplements, or on 2025 TikTok Shop supplement reporting, would fill those gaps.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"e28e3c23-e790-4235-bad6-e585d0b37d74","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:01:37.983Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"tiktok cayenne pepper pills trend circulation \"cayenne\" softgel viral 2025","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01V4QXEStuWjZ11DL1SCy22r","content":[{"title":"10 TikTok Health Trends Worth Trying—and Avoiding","url":"https://www.parsleyhealth.com/blog/tiktok-health-trends/"},{"title":"44 million people viewed viral 201602078","url":"https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/44-million-people-viewed-viral-201602078.html"},{"title":"TikTokers Claim This 'Skinny Girl Shot' Helps You Lose Weight & Here's What It Really Does","url":"https://www.narcity.com/tiktokers-claim-this-skinny-girl-shot-helps-you-lose-weight-heres-what-it-really-does"},{"title":"dailydot.com","url":"https://dailydot.com/?p=1650053"},{"title":"www.tiktokshop.com","url":"https://www.tiktokshop.com/pdp/cayenne-pepper-softgels-supplement-supports-circulation/1731315079510725077"},{"title":"A spicy chip challenge left one child dead and several others hospitalized. Here's why the chip is so dangerous","url":"https://www.mdlinx.com/article/a-spicy-chip-challenge-left-one-child-dead-and-several-others-hospitalized-heres-why-the-chip-is-so/3BQNtf6wREdIi1SR7QWHiV"},{"title":"skip to main content","url":"https://www.target.com/s/cayenne+pepper+capsules?Nao=864"},{"title":"Woman claims wellness influencer’s advice sent her to hospital with burnt esophagus","url":"https://malaysia.news.yahoo.com/woman-claims-wellness-influencer-advice-214139577.html"},{"title":"Woman claims wellness influencer’s advice sent her to hospital with burnt esophagus","url":"https://www.aol.com/woman-claims-wellness-influencer-advice-214139340.html"},{"title":"orange constipation hack","url":"https://www.buzzfeed.com/ravenishak/orange-constipation-hack"},{"title":"www.tiktokshop.com","url":"https://www.tiktokshop.com/pdp/cayenne-pepper-softgels-for-circulation-vitality-240-count/1731990967497298097"},{"title":"naturopath promotes scientifically unsubstantiated claim cayenne pepper most powerful blood thinner","url":"https://science.feedback.org/review/naturopath-promotes-scientifically-unsubstantiated-claim-cayenne-pepper-most-powerful-blood-thinner"},{"title":"The TikTok Food Trend So Bizarre The FDA Had To Get Involved","url":"https://www.aol.com/articles/tiktok-food-trend-bizarre-fda-003500493.html"},{"title":"tiktok health trends","url":"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/tiktok-health-trends/"},{"title":"www.mskcc.org","url":"https://www.mskcc.org/node/3219"},{"title":"what are the ingredients in the coffee loophole tiktok","url":"https://ntro.it.com/what-are-the-ingredients-in-the-coffee-loophole-tiktok"},{"title":"tiktok trend","url":"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/tag/tiktok-trend?page=2"},{"title":"The Viral Rise (and Risks) of Chilli Challenges","url":"https://www.futura-sciences.com/en/?p=37121"}]},"The search didn't find any reporting that a specific 2025 TikTok trend around cayenne softgels went viral. What it did turn up:\n\n- **Marketing:** TikTok Shop listings sell cayenne softgels, often bundled with vitamin D3+K2, beetroot, and hawthorn, and promote them for leg vein, heart, and circulation support. One listing shows 47.3K units sold. Sold by VIVONU S, 4.4 (3.2k), 47.3K sold\n- **Circulation claims:** Memorial Sloan Kettering notes that cayenne has traditionally been used to support digestion and blood circulation. Cayenne pepper is also used in traditional medicine to improve digestion and blood circulation. It also advises speaking with a healthcare provider before taking cayenne supplements. Talk with your healthcare providers before taking cayenne supplements.\n- **Unsupported claims:** Science Feedback reviewed a TikTok claim that cayenne is the most powerful blood thinner and found no scientific support for it. There is no scientific evidence supporting the use of cayenne pepper as a blood thinner.\n- **Safety concern:** One case report, cited by a medical news outlet, describes a healthy young man who had severe chest pain and a heart attack after taking \"slimming\" cayenne pepper pills. In fact, one healthy young male experienced severe chest pain and extensive inferior myocardial infarction after taking \"slimming\" cayenne pepper pills, according to the International Journal of Emergency Medicine. This is a single case, and I didn't verify the original report.\n\nGaps: I found no 2025 sales or trend data, and nothing from the FDA or a major outlet specifically on cayenne softgels. A follow-up search on FDA or poison-control warnings about cayenne supplements, or on 2025 TikTok Shop supplement reporting, would fill those gaps."],"durationSeconds":6.900606416999995,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VrAt2QwDpGMo7ZHkvM8PMu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
