{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SUJVrhz9bnNrgPFM2qWzhT","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"hawthorn beetroot supplement contraindications pregnancy heart medication digoxin nitrates\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"mountsinai.org\",\"url\":\"https://mountsinai.org/health-library/herb/hawthorn\"},{\"title\":\"drug 19908\",\"url\":\"https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-19908\"},{\"title\":\"www.mskcc.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.mskcc.org/cancer-care/integrative-medicine/herbs/hawthorn\"},{\"title\":\"www.webmd.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-733/hawthorn-berry-oral/details\"},{\"title\":\"Herbal supplements and heart medicines may not mix\",\"url\":\"https://www.mayoclinic.org/health/herbal-supplements/MY01874\"},{\"title\":\"list precautions\",\"url\":\"https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-733/hawthorn-berry-oral/details/list-precautions\"},{\"title\":\"www.drugs.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.drugs.com/cdi/hawthorn.html\"},{\"title\":\"Herbal supplements and heart medicines may not mix\",\"url\":\"https://www.mayoclinic.org/drugs-supplements/herbal-supplements/art-20046488\"},{\"title\":\"Herbal supplements and heart medicines may not mix\",\"url\":\"https://www.mayoclinic.org/drugs-supplements-herbal-supplements/art-20046488\"},{\"title\":\"drugs.com\",\"url\":\"https://Drugs.com/npp/hawthorn.html\"}]\n\nThe search turned up solid information on hawthorn, but nothing specific about beetroot combined with hawthorn, so I can't speak to any beetroot-specific interactions.\n\n**Pregnancy and breastfeeding:** Most sources advise against hawthorn in pregnancy. One says hawthorn should not be used during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Another notes that without clear data, hawthorn extracts should be avoided in pregnancy and during lactation, while also reporting that animal studies have not shown any adverse effect on embryonic development. The evidence is thin in both directions.\n\n**Digoxin:** This is the most consistently flagged interaction. One source explains that in vitro data suggest hawthorn contains alkaloids that are structurally similar to digoxin and may interfere with its action. The same source adds that hawthorn was safely coadministered at a specified dose in a small randomized, crossover trial of healthy volunteers, so clinical relevance is unclear. Other sources list digoxin as an interaction to discuss with a doctor, and one notes that hawthorn may enhance the activity of digoxin.\n\n**Nitrates:** One source says that taking hawthorn together with nitrates might increase the chance of dizziness or light headedness. Mayo Clinic lists nitrates such as nitroglycerin and isosorbide among drugs hawthorn might interact with.\n\n**Other cardiac medications:** Mayo Clinic also lists beta blockers, such as atenolol, nadolol or propranolol and calcium channel blockers, such as diltiazem, nifedipine and verapamil as possible interactions.\n\n**Other cautions:** Sources advise talking with a doctor if you have heart disease or low blood pressure. One notes that known allergy to members of the rose family is a contraindication. Another says the interactions between hawthorn and medicines are not fully understood.\n\nOverall, pregnancy and any use alongside digoxin or nitrates both call for medical supervision. I found no beetroot-specific data, so any beetroot interaction would need a separate search.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"25930e2b-7bd6-4557-8c0f-0f8b21424797","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:01:38.904Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"hawthorn beetroot supplement contraindications pregnancy heart medication digoxin nitrates","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_014qtympZx1UVcL9bBw7aCzg","content":[{"title":"mountsinai.org","url":"https://mountsinai.org/health-library/herb/hawthorn"},{"title":"drug 19908","url":"https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-19908"},{"title":"www.mskcc.org","url":"https://www.mskcc.org/cancer-care/integrative-medicine/herbs/hawthorn"},{"title":"www.webmd.com","url":"https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-733/hawthorn-berry-oral/details"},{"title":"Herbal supplements and heart medicines may not mix","url":"https://www.mayoclinic.org/health/herbal-supplements/MY01874"},{"title":"list precautions","url":"https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-733/hawthorn-berry-oral/details/list-precautions"},{"title":"www.drugs.com","url":"https://www.drugs.com/cdi/hawthorn.html"},{"title":"Herbal supplements and heart medicines may not mix","url":"https://www.mayoclinic.org/drugs-supplements/herbal-supplements/art-20046488"},{"title":"Herbal supplements and heart medicines may not mix","url":"https://www.mayoclinic.org/drugs-supplements-herbal-supplements/art-20046488"},{"title":"drugs.com","url":"https://Drugs.com/npp/hawthorn.html"}]},"The search turned up solid information on hawthorn, but nothing specific about beetroot combined with hawthorn, so I can't speak to any beetroot-specific interactions.\n\n**Pregnancy and breastfeeding:** Most sources advise against hawthorn in pregnancy. One says hawthorn should not be used during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Another notes that without clear data, hawthorn extracts should be avoided in pregnancy and during lactation, while also reporting that animal studies have not shown any adverse effect on embryonic development. The evidence is thin in both directions.\n\n**Digoxin:** This is the most consistently flagged interaction. One source explains that in vitro data suggest hawthorn contains alkaloids that are structurally similar to digoxin and may interfere with its action. The same source adds that hawthorn was safely coadministered at a specified dose in a small randomized, crossover trial of healthy volunteers, so clinical relevance is unclear. Other sources list digoxin as an interaction to discuss with a doctor, and one notes that hawthorn may enhance the activity of digoxin.\n\n**Nitrates:** One source says that taking hawthorn together with nitrates might increase the chance of dizziness or light headedness. Mayo Clinic lists nitrates such as nitroglycerin and isosorbide among drugs hawthorn might interact with.\n\n**Other cardiac medications:** Mayo Clinic also lists beta blockers, such as atenolol, nadolol or propranolol and calcium channel blockers, such as diltiazem, nifedipine and verapamil as possible interactions.\n\n**Other cautions:** Sources advise talking with a doctor if you have heart disease or low blood pressure. One notes that known allergy to members of the rose family is a contraindication. Another says the interactions between hawthorn and medicines are not fully understood.\n\nOverall, pregnancy and any use alongside digoxin or nitrates both call for medical supervision. I found no beetroot-specific data, so any beetroot interaction would need a separate search."],"durationSeconds":6.520521416999996,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SUJVrhz9bnNrgPFM2qWzhT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BL728urbHvMzheZsnHLab8","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"insuficiencia venosa várices Colombia porcentaje mujeres piernas pesadas cifras\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"• LUNES 13\",\"url\":\"https://elperuano.pe/noticia/244250-insuficiencia-venosa\"},{\"title\":\"hasta el 50 de los adultos podria padecer de insuficiencia venosa cronica ivc sin saberlo de que se trata 3469440\",\"url\":\"https://www.eltiempo.com/salud/hasta-el-50-de-los-adultos-podria-padecer-de-insuficiencia-venosa-cronica-ivc-sin-saberlo-de-que-se-trata-3469440\"},{\"title\":\"repository.urosario.edu.co\",\"url\":\"https://repository.urosario.edu.co/bitstreams/ea7e008f-a86d-4ab2-8b47-620ce698cf58/download\"},{\"title\":\"www.redalyc.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.redalyc.org/journal/120/12060716009/12060716009.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"revistas.udea.edu.co\",\"url\":\"https://revistas.udea.edu.co/index.php/fnsp/article/download/329708/20793758/173310\"},{\"title\":\"128039 las mujeres son las mas expuestas sufrir varices\",\"url\":\"https://www.infobae.com/2004/07/23/128039-las-mujeres-son-las-mas-expuestas-sufrir-varices/\"},{\"title\":\"le pesan o se le hinchan las piernas estas senales no deberian pasar desapercibidas rs15\",\"url\":\"https://www.bluradio.com/salud/le-pesan-o-se-le-hinchan-las-piernas-estas-senales-no-deberian-pasar-desapercibidas-rs15\"},{\"title\":\"jvb 21 e20220051 trans1\",\"url\":\"https://app.periodikos.com.br/article/10.1590/1677-5449.202200513/pdf/jvb-21-e20220051-trans1.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"en 0003 3170 angiologia 78 1 4\",\"url\":\"https://scielo.isciii.es/pdf/angiologia/v78n1/en_0003-3170-angiologia-78-1-4.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"scielo.br\",\"url\":\"https://scielo.br/j/jvb/a/Xwjd9SPwgyZsDb7xNcL6VKD/?lang=en\"},{\"title\":\"TFG M M1725%20%281%29\",\"url\":\"https://uvadoc.uva.es/bitstream/handle/10324/41442/TFG-M-M1725%20%281%29.pdf?sequence=1\"},{\"title\":\"jvb 21 e20220051\",\"url\":\"https://app.periodikos.com.br/article/10.1590/1677-5449.202200513/pdf/jvb-21-e20220051.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"reduzca la hinchazon de las venas varicosas con estos remedios caseros 746477\",\"url\":\"https://www.eltiempo.com/salud/reduzca-la-hinchazon-de-las-venas-varicosas-con-estos-remedios-caseros-746477\"},{\"title\":\"revangiologia.sld.cu\",\"url\":\"https://revangiologia.sld.cu/index.php/ang/article/download/173/264\"},{\"title\":\"CARTA DE LA SALUD OCT2020\",\"url\":\"https://valledellili.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/CARTA_DE_LA_SALUD_OCT2020.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"www.redalyc.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.redalyc.org/pdf/3455/345531926006.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Venas varicosas\",\"url\":\"https://www.msdmanuals.com/es/professional/trastornos-cardiovasculares/enfermedades-de-las-venas-perif%C3%A9ricas/venas-varicosas\"},{\"title\":\"hinchazon y pesadez en piernas no lo ignores podria ser insuficiencia venosa cronica\",\"url\":\"https://www.cronica.com.mx/nacional/2025/07/22/hinchazon-y-pesadez-en-piernas-no-lo-ignores-podria-ser-insuficiencia-venosa-cronica/\"},{\"title\":\"insuficiencia venosa abk5486\",\"url\":\"https://www.cigna.com/es-us/knowledge-center/hw/temas-de-salud/insuficiencia-venosa-abk5486\"}]\n\nSegún las fuentes encontradas, no hay una cifra nacional única y actualizada para Colombia, pero sí hay datos útiles con distinta calidad:\n\n- **Cifra general más citada:** Una nota de Blu Radio atribuye a la Fundación Valle del Lili la estimación de que la insuficiencia venosa crónica puede afectar al 30 % de la población general, con várices en el 25 % y el 33 % de las mujeres y entre el 10 % y el 20 % de los hombres. Es una fuente periodística que cita a una institución, no un estudio epidemiológico que pueda revisar directamente.\n- **Estudio poblacional con cifras bajas:** Un estudio en Colombia registró una prevalencia de várices del 27,5 % y de insuficiencia venosa crónica del 0,8 %. Sin embargo, sus palabras clave mencionan a población amerindia embera-chamí, así que probablemente no representa a la población general.\n- **Pacientes de clínica especializada:** Un análisis de 1.136 pacientes tratados por várices en una clínica colombiana describe a mujeres como la gran mayoría, 79,8% mujeres y 20,2% hombres, con edad media de unos 53 años. Esto refleja quiénes consultan, no la prevalencia en la población.\n- **Otra cifra de prensa:** Un artículo de El Tiempo titulado \"hasta el 50 %\" habla de adultos que podrían tener insuficiencia venosa crónica sin saberlo, pero el texto visible no mostró el sustento de esa cifra.\n- **Contexto sobre el sexo:** Una revisión de Medicina Vascular (MSD) indica que las várices son más comunes en mujeres, en parte porque los estrógenos afectan la estructura venosa y el embarazo aumenta la presión venosa.\n\nConclusión: para una respuesta sólida, conviene citar el 25–33 % de mujeres con várices como estimación de Valle del Lili y advertir que es una fuente secundaria. Los datos de estudios académicos son más variables y dependen de la población estudiada. No encontré una encuesta nacional colombiana reciente que confirme estas cifras. Las cifras de México (68,7 %) que aparecieron en los resultados no corresponden a Colombia y las descarté.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae1b95f-0a75-4473-b2e5-cff7fb3dca41","uuid":"e0c4f7bb-c8ed-48a7-aa42-421da410d9d4","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:01:39.370Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"insuficiencia venosa várices Colombia porcentaje mujeres piernas pesadas cifras","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MX8pHj1G6ntZ4hh61yCCTF","content":[{"title":"• LUNES 13","url":"https://elperuano.pe/noticia/244250-insuficiencia-venosa"},{"title":"hasta el 50 de los adultos podria padecer de insuficiencia venosa cronica ivc sin saberlo de que se trata 3469440","url":"https://www.eltiempo.com/salud/hasta-el-50-de-los-adultos-podria-padecer-de-